# Canonical host consolidation — all authority lands on https://www.lorsam.com
# Absolute-URL sources are matched by Cloudflare Pages before any path rule.
https://lorsam.com/*   https://www.lorsam.com/:splat   301!
http://lorsam.com/*    https://www.lorsam.com/:splat   301!
http://www.lorsam.com/*  https://www.lorsam.com/:splat  301!
https://lorsam.pages.dev/*  https://www.lorsam.com/:splat  301!

# Client-side router fallback: static assets are served first, everything else
# renders the SPA shell with a 200 so deep links keep their canonical URL.
/*  /index.html  200
